ing.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">White mustard seeds are used in pickling spices and spice blends for meats and seafood.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Powdered mustard enhances mayonnaise, salad dressings, barbecue sauces, baked beans, deviled eggs, and more.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Health &amp; Nutritional Benefits<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rich in selenium and magnesium, known for anti-inflammatory properties.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aids digestion and boosts metabolism.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mustard oil helps in promoting heart health and is widely valued for its medicinal uses.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Applications<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Food processing industry<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pickling &amp; spice blends<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Condiment preparation<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Oil extraction<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Culinary seasonings<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Why Choose Bombay Foodstuff Mustard Seeds?<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Carefully selected and cleaned seeds.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Available in bulk packaging for exporters and food industries.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ensures strong flavor, purity, and consistency.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bombay Foodstuff offers premium mustard seeds (Peeli Sarson) sourced from trusted growers. Widely used in oil extraction, condiments, pickling, and food processing, our mustard seeds deliver rich flavor and aroma. Available in bulk export-grade packaging, they meet international quality standards, making them ideal for B2B buyers in spice, food, and oil industries.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1204,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[25],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-821","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-uncategorized","first","instock","shipping-taxable","product-type-simple"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product\/821","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/product"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=821"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1204"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=821"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"product_brand","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product_brand?post=821"},{"taxonomy":"product_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product_cat?post=821"},{"taxonomy":"product_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product_tag?post=821"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"h